The images for Windows (vbackup.exe, units.exe) have StarLet compiled in,
https://github.com/SysMan-One/utility_routines - Apache License 2.0, the
same author.

They are also linked statically with the runtime of MinGW-w64, and so
carry its winpthreads library - the expat license (mingw-w64 project)
and the BSD 3-clause license (Lockless Inc.); the texts are in
win/COPYING.MinGW-w64, given with every copy of these images.

LZ4 block, Deflate (RFC 1951) and LZMA are implementations of their own,
written from the published descriptions of the formats; no code of the
reference implementations is included.
